{"track":"python","category":"기초 문법","level":2,"title":"홀수만 더하기","desc":"<p>1부터 <code>n</code>까지의 정수 중 <b>홀수만</b> 더한 값을 돌려주는 <code>sum_odds(n)</code>을 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def sum_odds(n):\n    pass\n","solution":"def sum_odds(n):\n    total = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if i % 2 == 1:\n            total += i\n    return total\n","hint":"<p>반복문 안에서 <code>if i % 2 == 1</code> 일 때만 더해요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"sum_odds(10)","expected":25,"visible":true},{"call":"sum_odds(1)","expected":1,"visible":true},{"call":"sum_odds(0)","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"sum_odds(7)","expected":16,"visible":false},{"call":"sum_odds(100)","expected":2500,"visible":false}],"id":"py-034"}